--- stderr ---
error: skills adopt: skill by-origin is not installed in this project (neither .claude/skills/by-origin nor .agents/skills/by-origin exists), so there is nothing to adopt; run `labdrian skills install --project-id github.com/acme/demo`
error: skills adopt: refused, so nothing was adopted

$ skills adopt --registry <WORLD>/overlay/skills.registry.yaml --source-root <WORLD>/overlay/skills --project-id chosen (in demo)
